<title>USA: North Fork Bancorp sets two-for-one split.</title>
<headline>North Fork Bancorp sets two-for-one split.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Fork Bancorp Inc said on Tuesday that its board of directors approved a two-for-one common stock split.</p>
<p>The split is subject to a shareholder vote on April 25, 1997, to increase the company's authorized common shares to 200 million from 50 million, North Fork said.</p>
<p>North Fork said it presently has 33 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk   212-859-1610))</p>
